WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:21.109
Ginger: Meow!

2
00:00:21.109 --> 00:00:24.974
Sam: Hi, Ginger.

3
00:00:24.975 --> 00:00:26.850
Ginger: Meow!

4
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.120
Sam: I wish you liked dogs.

5
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.620
Sam: My dog, Lucky, is really smart.

6
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.700
Sam: He can sit and speak and shake hands.

7
00:00:37.897 --> 00:00:40.494
Sam: I mean, paws!

8
00:00:40.495 --> 00:00:44.104
Ginger: Purr . . . purr . . .

9
00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:47.450
Sam: And he loves to play fetch . . .

10
00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:51.770
Sam: I throw a ball, and he . . .

11
00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.902
Sam: Hi, Mom! Hi, Lilly! I'm home!

12
00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:00.910
Mom: Hi, Sam! Did you have a good time?

13
00:01:01.498 --> 00:01:04.842
Lilly: Ba-ba-ba-ba-ba!

14
00:01:04.842 --> 00:01:09.542
Sam: Yes. We played superheroes and watched a movie.

15
00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.560
Mom: Did you get homesick?

16
00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:18.140
Sam: No! Well . . . maybe a little. But we had fun!

17
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.240
Mom: I'm glad, honey. Welcome home.

18
00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:28.165
Sam: Where's Lucky? I—

19
00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:31.600
Sam: Lucky! That's enough, silly boy.

20
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.240
Sam: Want to play in the snow?

21
00:01:35.241 --> 00:01:38.770
Lucky: Woof! Woof!

22
00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:43.110
Sam: Good dog, Lucky! You are my best friend!
